  "description": "The Alta Vista, like the Buena Vista, is a true mixte frame with the double top tube/stays extending front to rear. While the Buena Vista was designed to be as a sport touring bike with drop bars, the Alta Vista is specifically designed as a gravel bike for flat bars or city bars.\n\nIts retro good looks gets second glances on your errands or commutes, but it is rugged enough for off road fun and loaded touring.\n\nRack and fender eyelets\n\nTakes 1-1/8\" threadless headset\n\n132.5mm hub spacing to fit either road or MTB hubs\n\nSizes: 42(SM), 46(MED), 50(LG), 53(XL)\n\nComponent Specifications and FAQ's:\n\nCompatible with downtube shifters (covers not included for bosses)\n\nReviews\n\nTestimonials",
